RUNEPRIEST-ALLOY.description:
Remove the last rune of your Incantation.
If you do, draw {Cards} {Cards:plural:card|cards}.{IfUpgraded:show:
{ImbuedCount:choose(0):[gold]Imbue[/gold] {Imbue}.|{ImbuedRunes}}|}

RUNEPRIEST-FRENZIED_INCANT.description:
{IfUpgraded:show:{ImbuedCount:choose(0):[gold]Imbue[/gold] {Imbue}.|{ImbuedRunes}}
|}[gold]Inscribe[/gold] [blue]Loop[/blue].
Put [blue]Scatter[/blue] at the start of your Incantation.

RUNEPRIEST-CURSED_ARMOUR.description:
You can't gain [gold]Block[/gold] until your next turn.
Next turn, [gold]Inscribe[/gold] [blue]Mend[/blue] equal to the HP you lost.{IfUpgraded:show:
Until then, reflect damage you take.|}

RUNEPRIEST-IMBUED_SHIELD.description:
Gain {Block:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold], doubled while this card is [gold]Imbued[/gold].
{ImbuedCount:choose(0):[gold]Imbue[/gold] {Imbue}.|{ImbuedRunes}
Empty this card's Imbue slot.}

RUNEPRIEST-CLEAN_SLATE.description:
Remove the last rune of your Incantation.
[gold]Inscribe[/gold] [blue]Void[/blue].{IfUpgraded:show:
Draw {Cards} {Cards:plural:card|cards}.|}

RUNEPRIEST-REROUTE_ENERGY.description:
Remove ALL runes from your Incantation.
Gain 1 [gold]Energy[/gold] for each rune removed.{IfUpgraded:show:
Add an [gold]Old Lantern[/gold] to your hand.|}
